  - 'Rana: Uhhh'
  - 'Sheriff Clint: Of course it does yah lil oaf! Now here''s the bounty.'
  - 'Rana: Oh my gosh I''m so excited!'
  - 'Sheriff Clint: I jus'' need you to help Jesse back at the ranch to catch our
    town outlaw! Winston!'
  - 'Rana: On it!'
