  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sentences:
  - '???: How''re you doing. Need any weapons? '
  - 'Rana: No thanks I don''t fight. Not really built for it. '
  - '???: Suit yourself. What brings you to town? We''re not exactly a tourist location.'
  - 'Rana: I''m heading up the island. '
  - '???: Why is that? '
  - 'Rana: Uh. Let''s say treasure.'
  - '???: Well that''s nice. I hope your trip goes well. '
  - 'Rana: Thanks. Do you sell much in a town like this? '
  - '???: Well Henson sure breaks a lot of stuff fighting off trees. So I get pretty
    good business here.'
  - 'Rana: Sorry I never got your name?'
  - '???: I''m Mr. Smith. I hang out here making stuff all day. But luckily I have
    this duck to keep me company.'
  - 'Rana: That sounds like a nice life. '
