--- !u!114 &215827067
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 215827065}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e4d333fa1048a3642a8067a367f2cfd7, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sentences:
  - "Rana: Hey there young lady how\u2019re ya doin\u2019? "
  - 'Jessy: Ah!- I mean, uhh, hi. Nice to meet you my names Jessy.'
  - "Rana: Oh you don\u2019t speak with an accent. Are you from here?"
  - "Jessy: Let\u2019s keep that a secret from \u201CSheriff Clint\u201D please?
    I can\u2019t stand doing that stupid voice."
  - "Jessy: \u201COh wontcha sayve may Deputaayyy?!\u201D... I have formal education.
    I\u2019m better than that."
  - "Rana: So I take that as a no, you\u2019re not from here."
  - 'Jessy: Nah, my mom was from here, she used to be the lass.'
  - "Jessy: she couldn\u2019t come this year so I came in to fill in for her."
  - "Rana: Oh, well what does \u201Cfilling in for her\u201D entail?"
  - 'Jessy: Eh basic lass stuff, get kidnapped, get saved, ride off into the sunset
    with the deputy on a horse.'
  - 'Jessy: Or that would be it if the outlaw actually did any crimes, or our deputy
    even liked horses.'
  - "Rana: And now that y\u2019all don\u2019t have a horse?"
  - 'Jessy: -What!? I knew nothing about this before you brought it up! Nope, not
    a thing at all!'
  - "Rana: Wait, so if y\u2019all don\u2019t do that what does go on around here? "
  - 'Jessy: Well, last night Deputy Jesse, Winston and I all snuck off to the village
    just up the hill and got some ramen.'
  - 'Jessy: We came back then Winston dropped his script while we snuck on top of
    the ranch roof. '
  - "Jessy: if I cared more I might have actually went up and grabbed it to return
    it. I\u2019m more concerned about my lost tablet."
  - 'Rana: Your lost what? '
  - 'Jessy: I was gifted a magic tablet of information when I came out here. I lost
    it somewhere.'
  - 'Rana: Tablet of information?'
  - 'Jessy: Or that would be it if the outlaw actually did any crimes, or our deputy
    even liked horses.'
  - "Jessy: Yeah, It\u2019ll answer as many questions as I\u2019ll ask."
  - "Jessy: But it\u2019ll also do 1 question per person who doesn\u2019t own it.
    Can\u2019t remember where I put it."
  - "Rana: I\u2019ll keep an eye out for it, if I find it and return it can I ask
    something? "
  - 'Jessy: Sure can!'
  - "Rana: I\u2019ll keep an eye out."
  charactersSpeaking: 0200000004000000020000000400000004000000020000000400000004000000020000000400000004000000020000000400000002000000040000000400000004000000020000000400000002000000040000000400000004000000020000000400000002000000
