--- !u!114 &609184271
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 609184269}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e4d333fa1048a3642a8067a367f2cfd7, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sentences:
  - 'Sheriff Clint: Howdy Parder, sorry you had ta visit this here town on such a
    sad day.  '
  - "Rana: What\u2019s so sad about it? "
  - 'Sheriff Clint: That there burger. '
  - "Rana: \u2026 "
  - "Rana: I\u2019m a little confused, what\u2019s wrong with the burger? "
  - 'Sheriff Clint: Well I took a nibble and the burger itself is actually quite
    delicious.  '
  - "Rana: What\u2019s so sad then? "
  - 'Sheriff Clint: Well that burger was the town horse just last night. Someone
    done and made burgers from him when I were asleep! '
  - 'Rana: Oh my stars! Wh- who could have done something so awful? '
  - "Sheriff Clint: Ya see there\u2019s our predicament Pardner: we got no idea. "
  - "Sheriff Clint: We won\u2019t be opening up the gate til\u2019 we got some sorta
    idea whodunit in this here town. "
  - 'Rana: Good luck finding ou- '
  - 'Sheriff Clint: There are only 3 suspects! '
  - 'Sheriff Clint: First off that darn town outlaw! Winston, he always has had it
    out for this town. '
  - 'Rana: Maybe it was the criminal who did the crime- '
  - 'Sheriff Clint: Or maybe it was the Little Lass Jessy! She always had hated it
    here.'
  - "Sheriff Clint:  She\u2019s never been the working type, she would love to eat
    our only horse.  "
  - 'Rana: Maybe it wa- '
  - "Sheriff Clint: Or maybe it was even my own son\u2026 Deputy Jesse."
  - "Sheriff Clint: He\u2019s been mighty happy on that new cow of his after the
    horse got butched. "
  - 'Rana: I hope you fin- '
  - 'Sheriff: Alright detective best of luck to ya. '
  - "Rana: Oh no you\u2019re mistaken I\u2019m just a bartender passing through town. "
  - 'Sheriff Cilnt: Oh well in that case I hereby deputize ya!  '
  - 'Rana: Wha- '
  - 'Sheriff Clint: As ur first job ya gotta find out whodunthis! '
  - "Rana: I don\u2019t acce- "
  - "Sheriff Clint: Ya ain\u2019t passing through town till that gates open..."
  - "Sheriff Clint: And that gate ain\u2019t opening till we find out who made this
    here burger.  "
  - "Rana: \u2026 "
  - 'Rana: Why not just send the actual deputy?  '
  - "Sheriff Clint: Can\u2019t, cause he\u2019s a suspect. Please, you\u2019re the
    only person we know didn\u2019t do it\u2026"
  - "Sheriff Clint:  and that they\u2019ll talk to. "
  - 'Rana: This is none of my business, someone will come along. '
  - 'Rana: I hope you fin- '
  - 'Sheriff Clint: Someone has come along. '
  - "Rana: \u2026 "
  - 'Rana: Where should I check first?  '
  - "Sheriff Clint: Make conversation with the town here, ain\u2019t nobody aware
    you're on the lookout for a butcher yet! They might give ya some clues. "
  - 'Rana: Got it. '
  charactersSpeaking: 
  index: 0
