  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sentences:
  - '???: How did you find me!?'
  - 'Rana: I mean you''re clothes are pretty brigh-'
  - 'Suki: I am Suki! The best female ninja in this village!'
  - 'Rana: Well you''re the only one I can seem to find so apparnetly not.'
  - 'Suki: *gasp* You take that back you knumbskull!'
  - 'Rana:  Ok ok fine you''re great.'
  - 'Suki: I hope Yurei doesn''t see me as easily as you did.'
  - 'Rana: What are you doing here anyways?'
  - 'Suki: Waiting for the boy of my dreams to come by. '
  - 'Rana: Don''t you think he might get creeped out by you being here? '
  - 'Suki: Havent you ever been in love?'
  - 'Rana: A while ago yeah.'
  - 'Suki: Well then you''d get it when I say I''d do crazy things for love. '
