  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sentences:
  - ???:Halt
  - 'Rana: Who goes there?'
  - '???: I am the elder tree, child.'
  - 'Rana: You can talk?'
  - 'Elder Tree: Of course, child, I have watched for many thousands of years over
    mount nate.'
  - 'Rana: Im 95 years old, I''m hardly a child.'
  - 'Elder Tree: Even the most ancient animal is a child to the earth.'
  - 'Rana: Well, Mr. Elder Tree. I came here to speak to this grave.'
  - 'Rana: Could I pretend you''re not here and speak to my old loved one?'
  - 'Elder Tree: Of course, I am as present as the air around you, always there but
    never to impede.'
  - 'Rana: Ok, here I go.'
